# Core Repository Context

- Read `AGENTS.md` at the start of repository-level work.
- Treat `docs/product/MVP.md` as the source of truth for current scope.
- Treat `docs/architecture/current.md` as the source of truth for implemented architecture.
- Treat `docs/architecture/target.md` as the source of truth for near-term intended architecture.
- Prefer updating an existing authoritative doc over creating a new one.
- Keep solutions simple and aligned with the current milestone.
- Do not add shared packages, microservices, queues, or infrastructure early unless the change explicitly requires them.
